{"about_the_game":"<i>Paradox Soul</i> is a 2D explorative action-shooter hybrid. You play Dr Alli Rose, a research scientist who stumbles across a peculiar test facility, determined to unravel the mystery and take on whatever evil is in her path. Shoot, cover and dash your way through this nightmarish Metroidvania game!<br><br>Key Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro pixel art and animation<br></li><li>Terrifyingly epic boss fights<br></li><li>Unique suit abilities for combat and navigation<br></li><li>Cool weaponry upgrades to discover<br></li><li>Hand-crafted labyrinth of evil<br></li><li>Secrets to unravel</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/610570?t=1750321850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750321850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750321850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750321850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83e\uddec Paradox Soul Gets Steam Trading Cards! \ud83d\udc7e</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello Agents,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up and get ready \u2014 <strong>Paradox Soul</strong> now comes with <strong>Steam Trading Cards</strong>! Dive deeper into the mystery and unlock exclusive rewards as you uncover the secrets buried in this chilling metroidvania adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what\u2019s now available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Steam Trading Cards</strong> featuring atmospheric art from the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Profile Badges</strong> to craft and collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>New Backgrounds</strong> that bring the Paradox world to your profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddca <strong>Unique Emoticons</strong> with a sci-fi edge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re replaying to grab those last secrets or starting your first expedition, now there\u2019s even more reason to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing, and keep digging... you never know what you'll uncover. \ud83e\uddec</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Paradox Soul</i> is a 2D explorative action-shooter hybrid. You play Dr Alli Rose, a research scientist who stumbles across a peculiar test facility, determined to unravel the mystery and take on whatever evil is in her path. Shoot, cover and dash your way through this nightmarish Metroidvania game!<br><br>Key Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro pixel art and animation<br></li><li>Terrifyingly epic boss fights<br></li><li>Unique suit abilities for combat and navigation<br></li><li>Cool weaponry upgrades to discover<br></li><li>Hand-crafted labyrinth of evil<br></li><li>Secrets to unravel</li></ul>","developers":["Ritual Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610570/header.jpg?t=1750321850","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/610570/142784/2e2e2e42801d6eb8dacd5819c74ab19a0fe5f421/1751161159/dash_av1.mpd?t=1516829158","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/610570/142784/2e2e2e42801d6eb8dacd5819c74ab19a0fe5f421/1751161159/dash_h264.mpd?t=1516829158","highlight